ArchitectureCraft - GTNH shape port
===================================

This fork adds the roof slope, glowing roof, square, slab and angled/double
roof shapes from GTNewHorizons/ArchitectureCraft to the 1.12 TridentMC
codebase.

The following material is derived from GTNewHorizons/ArchitectureCraft:

- the slope renderer methods in
  src/main/java/com/elytradev/architecture/client/render/shape/RenderRoof.java;
- the models
  src/main/resources/assets/architecturecraft/models/shape/square.objson,
  src/main/resources/assets/architecturecraft/models/shape/angled_roof_ridge.objson and
  src/main/resources/assets/architecturecraft/models/shape/double_roof_tile.objson;
- the new menu icons in
  src/main/resources/assets/architecturecraft/textures/gui/shapemenu_items.png and
  src/main/resources/assets/architecturecraft/textures/gui/shapemenu_items_1.png.

